{"version":1,"content":"<p>《亞洲週刊》微信公號「亞周在線」報道，沸沸揚揚的南京博物院文物事件主角、南京博物院原院長徐湖平在10月12日下午6時許病逝於南京一家監獄醫院，終年81歲。</p><p>據了解，徐湖平患有肺癌，已是晚期。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.833434+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T05:20:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:37.659042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416450+00:00","content_hash":"eb57a329d05a0e73650062d84b6c9c8ecdf95adfcf320d284467f3e642c04f60","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}